{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t海關在機場檢查進口包裹，發現10隻懷疑受管制、屬瀕危物種的活龜，估計市值共約10萬元。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n海關人員檢查兩個今日由美國進口至香港，報稱載有塑膠家居產品的包裹，發現內有該批懷疑受管制、屬瀕危物種的活龜。案件轉交漁護署跟進。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：陳曉慶\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T03:38:11.137180+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":115,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-31T12:23:17+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-01T03:31:25.325350+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:31:25.325350+00:00","content_hash":"8ebf38bf52b50c719b76f00c888133ad13fd91c7f92d3405ea0116498b769c1a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}